      "narration": {
        "text": {
          "en": "He hopped onto the rim of the pot and peeked inside. There was water! But oh no... the water was too low, resting way down at the very bottom. He stretched his neck and reached down with his beak as far as he could, but it was just too deep. He could not drink. For a moment, the poor little bird felt very sad and helpless.",
          "hi": "उसने घड़े के ऊपर बैठकर अंदर झाँका। पानी तो था! लेकिन... पानी बहुत नीचे था। उसने अपनी चोंच को जितना हो सके उतना लंबा किया, लेकिन पानी तक नहीं पहुँच पाया। वह बेचारा उदास हो गया, 'अब मैं क्या करूँ?'"
        },
